    "name": "David's Mighty Warriors",
    "steam_appid": 3771680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/3f5067b0c30c693762d685efc17e93b5.avif?t=1750163056\" data-has-big width=800 height=233 /></span>Step into the sandals of King David\u2019s \u201celite squad\u201d.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David's Mighty Warriors is a story driven, action adventure, team based game,<br>where you lead a band of misfit biblical heroes and aim their  special moves<br>as you fight to stop Prince Absalom's rebellion. <br><br>2 Samuel, among the Bible\u2019s most heroic books, reimagined as a witty,<br>action-packed adventure.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:<br>Aim Your Companions\u2019\u00a0Special Moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat blends melee attacks through the playable character - <strong>Abishai</strong>,<br>and ranged special moves by aiming your companions.   <br>Some foes can only be overcome by leveraging your team's unique abilities.<br><br><strong>Abishai Son Of Zeruiah</strong> -\u00a0Melee<br><strong>Asahel Son Of Zeruiah</strong> - Stun<br><strong>Abigial</strong> - Rappid Arrows<br><strong>Ittai The Gittite</strong> - High Damage<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/596c78ee2027f1b43fc4d5b8ad8914e1.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/596c78ee2027f1b43fc4d5b8ad8914e1.webm?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/596c78ee2027f1b43fc4d5b8ad8914e1.mp4?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Legendary Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, discover powerful relics named in the verses of 1\u00a0Samuel &amp; 2 Samuel: David's sling, Jonathan's Bow &amp; Goliath's Sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions will be using them to unlock their ultra combat skills.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/4ee50bd21fd96c4de1f4c8199653d3df.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/4ee50bd21fd96c4de1f4c8199653d3df.webm?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/4ee50bd21fd96c4de1f4c8199653d3df.mp4?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Biblical Foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game's plot takes place during Absalom's rebellion,<br>players will face boss enemies from that period, including: <br><strong>Absalom</strong> himself, <strong>Ahitophel\u00a0</strong>the cunning advisor, and <strong>Eliam son of Ahitophel</strong> - a former member of David's Mighty Warriors who has now turned against his old allies.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/972de939ac633a6d157cc69aaa6cacac.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/972de939ac633a6d157cc69aaa6cacac.webm?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/972de939ac633a6d157cc69aaa6cacac.mp4?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Source-Based Biblical Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David\u2019s story is filled with rich, fascinating biblical lore.<br>Discover it throughout your journey and dive deeper through the lore menu.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/17255611458964cc5ea7f1937396c8fa.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/17255611458964cc5ea7f1937396c8fa.webp?t=1750163056\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/3f5067b0c30c693762d685efc17e93b5.avif?t=1750163056\" data-has-big width=800 height=233 /></span>Step into the sandals of King David\u2019s \u201celite squad\u201d.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David's Mighty Warriors is a story driven, action adventure, team based game,<br>where you lead a band of misfit biblical heroes and aim their  special moves<br>as you fight to stop Prince Absalom's rebellion. <br><br>2 Samuel, among the Bible\u2019s most heroic books, reimagined as a witty,<br>action-packed adventure.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:<br>Aim Your Companions\u2019\u00a0Special Moves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat blends melee attacks through the playable character - <strong>Abishai</strong>,<br>and ranged special moves by aiming your companions.   <br>Some foes can only be overcome by leveraging your team's unique abilities.<br><br><strong>Abishai Son Of Zeruiah</strong> -\u00a0Melee<br><strong>Asahel Son Of Zeruiah</strong> - Stun<br><strong>Abigial</strong> - Rappid Arrows<br><strong>Ittai The Gittite</strong> - High Damage<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/596c78ee2027f1b43fc4d5b8ad8914e1.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/596c78ee2027f1b43fc4d5b8ad8914e1.webm?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/596c78ee2027f1b43fc4d5b8ad8914e1.mp4?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Legendary Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your journey unfolds, discover powerful relics named in the verses of 1\u00a0Samuel &amp; 2 Samuel: David's sling, Jonathan's Bow &amp; Goliath's Sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your companions will be using them to unlock their ultra combat skills.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/4ee50bd21fd96c4de1f4c8199653d3df.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/4ee50bd21fd96c4de1f4c8199653d3df.webm?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/4ee50bd21fd96c4de1f4c8199653d3df.mp4?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge Biblical Foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game's plot takes place during Absalom's rebellion,<br>players will face boss enemies from that period, including: <br><strong>Absalom</strong> himself, <strong>Ahitophel\u00a0</strong>the cunning advisor, and <strong>Eliam son of Ahitophel</strong> - a former member of David's Mighty Warriors who has now turned against his old allies.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/972de939ac633a6d157cc69aaa6cacac.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/972de939ac633a6d157cc69aaa6cacac.webm?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/972de939ac633a6d157cc69aaa6cacac.mp4?t=1750163056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Source-Based Biblical Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >David\u2019s story is filled with rich, fascinating biblical lore.<br>Discover it throughout your journey and dive deeper through the lore menu.<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/17255611458964cc5ea7f1937396c8fa.poster.avif?t=1750163056\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771680/extras/17255611458964cc5ea7f1937396c8fa.webp?t=1750163056\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=450 /></picture></span></p>",
